OL,3,CWinning Manchester City booed and
OL,4,Ctaunted in first match since financial
OL,5,Ccharges
OL,7,FManchester City players were booed and
OL,8,Ftaunted as the club played their first
OL,9,Fgame since being found guilty of
OL,10,Ffinancial charges by the Premier
OL,11,FLeague.
OL,13,FDespite the hostile environment
OL,14,Fhowever City made the most of
OL,15,FLiverpool being reduced to 10 men in
OL,16,Fthe second half, putting three past
OL,17,Ftheir rivals to secure their first
OL,18,Fback-to-back league wins at Anfield
OL,19,Fsince January 1953.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G1/7
