PN,30402
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F304A1791798502
OL,3,CWinning Manchester City booed and
OL,4,Ctaunted in first match since financial
OL,5,Ccharges
OL,7,FBefore kick-off opposition fans held
OL,8,Fup banners portraying City as "cheats"
OL,9,Foutside the ground, while inside
OL,10,Fchants of "Cheats" and "You cheating
OL,11,Fb*******, we know what you are", could
OL,12,Fbe heard.
OL,14,FThe stadium DJ is also believed to
OL,15,Fhave joined in, with a playlist
OL,16,Fapparently selected by the players
OL,17,Fwhich included, "Blame" by Calvin
OL,18,FHarris and "It's not right but it's
OL,19,FOK" by Whitney Houston.
