OL,3,CWinning Manchester City booed and
OL,4,Ctaunted in first match since financial
OL,5,Ccharges
OL,7,FAnd, as City's players left the pitch
OL,8,Ffollowing their win, they were
OL,9,Faccompanied by the public address
OL,10,Fsystem playing Fleetwood Mac's Little
OL,11,FLies.
OL,13,FThere were no Oasis songs being played
OL,14,Fbut City fan Noel Gallagher, who was
OL,15,Fin attendance, will have seen his work
OL,16,Freferenced in a number of flags,
OL,17,Fbanners and T-shirts.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G3/7
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
