OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F304A1791798502
OL,3,CWinning Manchester City booed and
OL,4,Ctaunted in first match since financial
OL,5,Ccharges
OL,7,FAmong them were "Sham Pain Supernova",
OL,8,F"(What's The Story) Tainted Glory?",
OL,9,F"All of your stars are fading away",
OL,10,F"Look Back In Anger ` Shamchester" and
OL,11,F"And after all, you really robbed us
OL,12,Fall". There were also flags bearing
OL,13,Fthe word "Cheats" in the style of the
OL,14,FOasis logo.
OL,16,FOther banners referred to "A
OL,17,Fgeneration of supporters cheated" and
OL,18,F"Ch###ats" while there were depictions
OL,19,Fof former City manager Pep Guardiola
OL,20,Fand players in prison-issue black-and-
OL,21,Fwhite uniform.
