OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F304A1791798502
OL,3,CWinning Manchester City booed and
OL,4,Ctaunted in first match since financial
OL,5,Ccharges
OL,7,FDespite the tense atmosphere, and
OL,8,Frelentless booing within Anfield, City
OL,9,Fshowed it was business as usual for
OL,10,Fthe Premier League leaders.
OL,12,FErling Haaland made the crucial
OL,13,Fbreakthrough in front his father Alfe-
OL,14,FInge in the stands, just three minutes
OL,15,Fafter Ryan Gravenberch was sent off
OL,16,Ffor a second bookable offence, in the
OL,17,Fsecond half.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G5/7
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
