PN,30406
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F304A1791798502
OL,3,CWinning Manchester City booed and
OL,4,Ctaunted in first match since financial
OL,5,Ccharges
OL,7,FSubsitute Jeremy Doku, who helped turn
OL,8,Fthe game the visitors' way after
OL,9,Fcoming on in the 56th minute, curled
OL,10,Fhome a second and Rayan Cherki rolled
OL,11,Fin a third.
OL,13,FLiverpool fans have reason more than
OL,14,Fmost to feel aggrieved by City, having
OL,15,Fbeen beaten to the title three times
OL,16,Fby their North West rivals.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G6/7
