OL,3,CWinning Manchester City booed and
OL,4,Ctaunted in first match since financial
OL,5,Ccharges
OL,7,FThe game which came after Manchester
OL,8,FCity were found guilty of 114 charges,
OL,9,Fwhich saw them arrange 'sham'
OL,10,Fcontracts and rely on 'sham'
OL,11,Fagreements to 'artificially inflate'
OL,12,Ftheir revenues and reduce costs by
OL,13,F#900million.
OL,15,FCity deny any wrongdoing and have
OL,16,Fappealed against the verdict of the
OL,17,Findependent commission which found
OL,18,Fthem guilty of the Premier League
OL,19,Fregulations relating to financial
OL,20,Faffairs.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G7/7
